    skos:altLabel "MIxS-HCR (hydrocarbon resources-cores)" ;
    skos:definition "A collection of terms appropriate when collecting samples and sequencing samples obtained from environments pertaining to hydrocarbon resources, specifically core samples." ;
    skos:exactMatch MIXS:0016015 ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/mixs> ;
    MIXS:use_cases "The microbial characterization of hydrocarbon occurrences, defined as the natural and artificial environmental features that are rich in hydrocarbons, from hydrocarbon rich formations, such as reservoir cores." .

