    skos:altLabel "MIxS-sediment" ;
    skos:definition "A collection of terms appropriate when collecting samples and sequencing samples obtained from the sedimentary area of aquatic environments." ;
    skos:exactMatch MIXS:0016011 ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/mixs> ;
    skos:note "Sedimentary layers in terrestrial environments will probably be better served by the soil extension." ;
    MIXS:use_cases "river bed or sea floor." .

